215	/**
216	 * A cents amount that arrived from OUTSIDE this process (Stripe metadata) and is
217	 * about to be handed to `debitWallet`. Integer, non-negative, finite — anything
218	 * else is refused rather than coerced, for the same reason `parseOrderPrice`
